# aPToP Exercise 6(j) solution.

laws boolean

theorem ex6j: (a ⇒ b) ∨ (b ⇒ a)
    (a ⇒ b) ∨ (b ⇒ a)              inclusion, twice
=   ¬a ∨ b ∨ ¬b ∨ a                symmetry of ∨
=   a ∨ ¬a ∨ b ∨ ¬b                excluded middle, twice
=   ⊤ ∨ ⊤                          idempotence of ∨, or base law
=   ⊤
